<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1176156/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Flash flooding was observed along State Highway 349  with multiple low water crossings impassable due to high water, especially along Independence Creek." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1176761/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Flash flooding reported in Marshall with water covering the road at the corner of West Grand Avenue and Ward Street as well as two other nearby intersections." .

