<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1176764/knowledge> rdfs:comment "One lane of Highway 110 North near Whitehouse closed due to flooding." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1176765/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Flash flooding reported with high water across portions of County Road 173 near Kilgore." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1176767/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Water reported to have entered a home on FM Road 9 south of FM Road 2625." .

