<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1176775/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Several roads flooded in Nacogdoches." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1176776/knowledge> rdfs:comment "FM Road 2497 near Highway 94 was flooded." .

