<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1177162/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Flash flooding along CR 1280 north of Groveton resulted in the roadway becoming impassable." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1177163/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Flash flooding along CR 233 and CR 358 north of Groveton resulted in roadways becoming impassable." .

