<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1182513/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Black Creek overflowed flooding Highway 326." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1182514/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Heavy rain flooded underpasses in Beaumont. Twin City Highway flooded through Central Gardens and multiple streets also flooded in Nederland." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1182525/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Heavy rain caused roads on the north side of Beaumont near the Parkdale Mall be be flooded." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1182527/knowledge> rdfs:comment "The Woodville Fire Department reported water covering multiple streets in Woodville along with Turkey Creek flooding nearby roads. Multiple roads were also flooded near Town Bluff and Fred." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1182528/knowledge> rdfs:comment "The river gage in Bevil Oaks indicated minor flooding from a thunderstorm." .

