<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1262412/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Pecos County Emergency Manager reported that 3 high water rescues were taking place 4  miles south of I-10 along RM 2023. Up to 4 ft of water was reported to be across the road. The total time interval during which the flood occurred is estimated from radar and estimated runoff time. The cost of damages is also estimated." .

