<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1265159/knowledge> rdfs:comment "A car was stranded in high water near the intersection of Loop 323 and Highway 271." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1265161/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Several high water rescues were needed for stranded motorists under the railroad overpasses in Longview, including Green Street and Nelson Street, Green Street and Cotton Street, and High Street and Cotton Street. In addition, several low lying areas across the city were flooded as well." .

