<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1265166/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Thunderstorms produced heavy rain that led to flash flooding. The exit from northbound Hwy 281 to Hwy 46 was closed for around 20 minutes with water over the road. There were water rescues of multiple people stuck in vehicles." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1265170/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Thunderstorms produced heavy rain that led to flash flooding. There was a swift water rescue on the I-35 feeder road near Buttermilk Branch in northern Austin." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1265173/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Thunderstorms produced heavy rain that led to flash flooding. Two vehicles were stranded in water on Steck Ave. near MOPAC in northern Austin. The occupants of these vehicles had to be rescued." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1265177/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Flash flooding occurred across the city of  Austin with 6 water rescues reported, some  of which included vehicles. On the 2200  Block of Hancock Drive near the Yarborough  Branch of the Austin Public Library, an unhoused  individual was swept away when Hancock Creek flooded. The body of the person was recovered downstream." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1265186/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Widespread flooding was reported across Denton with I-35W closed and diverted to I-35E." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1265274/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Thunderstorms produced heavy rain that led to flash flooding. There were multiple stranded vehicles and high water rescues reported across San Antonio." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1265276/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Thunderstorms produced heavy rain that led to flash flooding. Several low water crossings were closed over northeastern San Antonio." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1265277/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Thunderstorms produced heavy rain that led to flash flooding. There were stranded vehicle and water rescue along Old  O'Connor Road in northeastern San Antonio." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1265278/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Thunderstorms produced heavy rain that led to flash flooding. The lower deck of I-10 at Culebra Rd. was flooded in San Antonio." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1266223/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Traffic cameras showed road closure due to high water along frontage roads along I-10 E at Jensen. Broadcast media also reported submerged cars in the underpass along Navigation Blvd." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1266315/knowledge> rdfs:comment "AN emergency manager reported local street flooding at FM 517 at IH45, on FM 517 just west of the intersection at IH45." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1266341/knowledge> rdfs:comment "A storm chaser shared a video on social media showing the aftermath of heavy rains in Blessing Texas. A large area of standing water can be seen over one property. Additional videos showed debris over the roadway along FM 1862 from flooding. Shallow water was still flowing over the roadway several hours after the event concluded." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1266362/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Storm chaser shared video on social media showing ponding on I-69 frontage road." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1266381/knowledge> rdfs:comment "A storm chaser shared a video on social media showing the aftermath of heavy rains in Blessing Texas. A large area of standing water can be seen over one property. Additional videos showed debris over the roadway along FM 1862 from flooding. Shallow water was still flowing over the roadway several hours after the event concluded, with surrounding areas still inundated well after the rains ended." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1266388/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Minor flooding occurred over portions of FM 363." .

