<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1272339/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Thunderstorms produced heavy rain that led to flash flooding. The occupants of a vehicle were rescued after they were swept off the road on CR 381 in the vicinity of San Geronimo Creek northeast of Rio Medina." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1272340/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Thunderstorms produced heavy rain that led to flash flooding. There was a high water rescue on I-35 near the Windcrest Business Park along Walzem Creek." .

