<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1272350/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Thunderstorms produced heavy rain that led to flash flooding. There was water over Hwy 119 along with other low water crossings flooded near Smith Creek south of Yorktown." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1272664/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Emergency management reported 21 vehicles stalled in high water due to flash flooding across various portions of Midland, TX. The time of occurrence is estimated by radar. The total cost of damages is also estimated." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1272665/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Emergency Management reported many evacuations of campgrounds in the Big Bend area due to flash flooding. The time of occurrence is estimated by radar. No damages were reported." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1272666/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Extremely heavy rain around Marfa and Fort Davis produced widespread street flooding. The time of occurrence is estimated by radar. No damage was reported." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1272667/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Emergency Management in Alpine reported one home inundated by flooding due to heavy  rainfall and numerous road closures by local authorities. The time of occurrence is estimated by radar. The total cost of damages is also estimated." .

