<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1275504/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Minor roadway flooding along McNeil Avenue. The report was relayed through Spotter Network. The location and event time are approximate." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1275988/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Numerous reports were received of flash flooding within the city of Lubbock from law enforcement and members of the public. An intense thunderstorm slowly moved from southeast to northwest across the city of Lubbock producing heavy rainfall. Texas Tech University West Texas mesonet sites in the city of Lubbock recorded over an inch of rainfall in less than 20 minutes." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1275989/knowledge> rdfs:comment "Numerous reports were received of flash flooding within the city of Lubbock from law enforcement and members of the public. An intense thunderstorm slowly moved from southeast to northwest across the city of Lubbock producing heavy rainfall. Texas Tech University West Texas mesonet sites in the city of Lubbock recorded over an inch of rainfall in less than 20 minutes." .

