<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1177156> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Flash flooding prompted a swift water rescue along FM 3188 near Trinity." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1177158> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Flash flooding along TX Hwy 94 made the roadway impassable near Groveton." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1177159> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Flash flooding along CR 2662 resulted in the roadway becoming impassable." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1177161> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Flash flooding along US Hwy 287 near Groveton resulted in the roadway becoming impassable." .

