<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1185467> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Flash flooding reported with water covering the roadway on FM Road 15." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1185547> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Emergency management reported that CR 531 was closed due to flooding in southern Hamilton County." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1185550> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Emergency management reported several county roads were flooded on the western side of Coryell County." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1185553> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Emergency management reported that several county roads north of Whitesboro were impassable due to flowing water." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1185558> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "The Kaufman County Emergency Manager reported that flood waters had entered the foyer of his office in the city of Kaufman." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1185560> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Emergency management reported flooding along FM 2310 between FM 73 and US 84, including one car being swept off the road." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1186232> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Emergency management reported 8 to 10 inches of water on roadways at the intersection of US 75 and FM 121. US 75 became closed due to high water." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1186860> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Multiple flooded roadways across the county were reported." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1186879> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Multiple road closures were reported in Fort Worth including Old Granbury near Benbrook Lake, Alliance, 28th, and Old Decatur." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1186883> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Roadway flooding reported at Parkwood and Yearly Road in Plano." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1186889> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Multiple high water rescues were reported in Decatur and Rhome." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1186890> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Multiple roads were closed due to flooding across the county." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1186891> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Multiple roadways were flooded, including Interstate 635 in North Dallas, and several were closed due to flooding." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1186897> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Multiple high water rescues along various roadways in Carrollton were reported." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1187023> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Several country roads flooded across Angelina County including FM Road 324, 843 and 706. Several Lufkin city streets also flooded, including a bridge washout on Wilton Street off of Paul Avenue." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1187155> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Coleman Fire Chief reports 4 water rescues, several streets closed due to flooding, and water up to the window on a TXDOT truck." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1187157> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "An amateur radio operator reported 3 lanes of the road were covered with water with some areas at least 1 foot deep." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1187159> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Fire Department reported interior flooding to homes and flooded roadways. Also, 4 inches of rain fell with large hail (size unknown)." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1187428> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Numerous streets were reported flooded around Jasper including FM 252 south of town and multiple county roads north of town." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1187429> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Several roads were reported flooded in Lumberton and Silsbee, some with deep water. The gauge on Mill Creek also indicated the stream exceeded its banks." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1187436> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Flooding was reported from Spurger to Town Bluff on FM 92 and several county roads. Flooding resulted in the temporary closing of FM 92." .

