<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1260979> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Big Spring Fire Department reported a couple water rescues from vehicles at low water  crossings and water in an apartment building in Big Spring. The time of occurrence is estimated from radar. The location is also approximate, as is the cost of damages." .

