<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1260982> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "A report was received from the public via MPING that flash flooding of streets/roads was occurring between Lamesa and Ackerly. The time of occurrence is estimated from radar. No damage was reported." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1260983> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "A video was received from the public showing flash flooding on the southbound lane of Highway 67. Time is estimated by radar. Location is also estimated. No damage was reported." .

