<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1261618> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "A portion of Raguet Street was closed due to flooding." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1261619> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Multiple roads were flooded in Lufkin." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1261622> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Frank Street in front of St. Luke's Memorial Hospital was flooded and closed. Ellis Avenue and Angelina Street, Ellis Avenue and Raguet Street, Kurth Drive at the Ellen Trout Drive underpass, and all of Denman Avenue inside the loop were also closed due to flooding." .

