<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1261977> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Report from mPING: Street/road flooding; Street/road closed; Vehicles stranded." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1261978> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "A social media video showed water running over roadways in Corsicana." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1261979> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Man was rescued by first responders from submerged vehicle in private driveway off Battle Lake Rd near Mart." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1261980> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Emergency manager reported street flooding with water level above the bottom of a car in Marlin." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1261982> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Social media video showed significant flash flooding around the Piggly Wiggly in Athens." .

