<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1269417> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "The local fire department reported 2 to 3 feet of water over Avenue B and other local roads across the western half of Marathon. The duration of flash flooding is an estimation." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1269428> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "The fire department reported water over the road on CR 2126 near FM1269. Multiple spots of water over the road on FM 612 east of Fluvanna were also reported. The duration of this flash flooding is an estimation." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1269433> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Emergency manager reported two vehicles stalled in high water due to street flooding in southeast Midland. The duration of the flooding is an estimation. The property damage cost is also an estimation." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1269614> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "The emergency manager reported four vehicles stalled in high water due to flash flooding across southern portions of  Midland. Duration is estimated from radar and reports. The property damage cost is an estimation." .

