<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1270495> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "County Road 310 was closed from Highway 17 to County Road 309 due to flash flooding. The total time of occurrence was estimated from radar. No damage was reported." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1270498> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "Farm Road 2903 was closed over Cherry Creek due to water over the road. The total time of occurrence was estimated from radar. No damage was reported." .

