<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1270511> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "County Road 112 was closed from State Highway 17 to County Road 118 due to flash flooding. The total time of occurrence was estimated from radar. No damage was reported." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1270512> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "County Road 334 was closed due to flash flooding. The total time of occurrence was estimated from radar. No damage was reported." .

