<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1278509> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "EM reported that the full length of Kitty Kat Lane was closed due to flooding and is impassable." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1278514> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "EM reported East Boone Prairie Rd at Mineral Creek impassable due to flooding." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1278516> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "EM reported Little Mississippi Cemetery Rd impassable due to water about 1/2 mile  past the dump." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1278517> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "EM reported water over the roadway at 5500 S FM 46 west of Owensville." .

<http://floodkg.org/event/noaa/1278520> <http://floodkg.org/hasNarrative> "EM reported FM 1373 at Alligator Creek flooded and impassable." .

